	IonThrusterAccelerator10x20Icon = "Ion Thr. Acc."
	IonThrusterAccelerator10x20Desc = "An ion thruster accelerator for more efficient internal building. Switchable for use with different side and part sizes. See blueprint for direction arrow. Buff value depends on number of accelerators and thruster size. Requires power."
